namespace totvs.protheus.manufacturing.incominginspection

using namespace totvs.framework.structure.interface

/*/{Protheus.doc} NonconformitiesInterface
Interface do cadastro de Nao Conformidades.
@type class
@author willian.ramalho
@since 24/07/2026
/*/
@totvsFrameworkStructureInterface(description="Nao Conformidades")
class NonconformitiesInterface
    private data oInterface as object

    public method new() as object
    public method setInterface()
    public method getContract() as json
endclass

/*/{Protheus.doc} new
Metodo construtor da classe.
@type method
@author willian.ramalho
@since 24/07/2026
@return object, instancia da classe
/*/
method new() as object class NonconformitiesInterface
return self

/*/{Protheus.doc} setInterface
Monta a interface de Nao Conformidades via layout automatico
(buildStandardView). QIEA040.PRW nao tem legenda, cor, acao
customizada ou atalho proprios -- MenuDef so tem o aRotina padrao do
FWMBrowse/MVC (Pesquisar/Visualizar/Incluir/Alterar/Excluir).
@type method
@author willian.ramalho
@since 24/07/2026
/*/
method setInterface() class NonconformitiesInterface
    Local cModelId := "totvs.protheus.manufacturing.incominginspection.NonconformitiesModel" as character

    ::oInterface := BuildContract():new("nonconformities")
    ::oInterface:setModelId(cModelId, .T.)
    ::oInterface:buildStandardView()
return

/*/{Protheus.doc} getContract
Retorna o contrato JSON da interface.
@type method
@author willian.ramalho
@since 24/07/2026
@return json, Contrato da interface
/*/
method getContract() as json class NonconformitiesInterface
return ::oInterface:getContract()
